phoria. To save herself, she is forced to face an inner journey that perhaps will lead her to a new light. After three years of psychotherapy, that journey becomes a real journey \"on the road\" in the company of two friends: Franca, fifty, theater director and casting director, and Francesca, twenty-seven, actress with Down syndrome. Between uncontaminated nature and breathtaking landscapes, they will meet other women, each with an intense story to tell.","tagline":"Based on true stories and featuring real characters"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cTG9EjGd5pPYyDHbuOSUxoUUQPY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cTG9EjGd5pPYyDHbuOSUxoUUQPY.jpg","language":"it","width":1050,"height":1500}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpr9Jn2Yj2yNduRpBsHk5ubn2LS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lpr9Jn2Yj2yNduRpBsHk5ubn2LS.jpg","language":"xx","width":1280,"height":720}]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cTG9EjGd5pPYyDHbuOSUxoUUQPY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpr9Jn2Yj2yNduRpBsHk5ubn2LS.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Movie","dateCreated":"2024-08-02T17:11:01Z","dateModified":"2025-05-03T15:27:55Z","description":"“Lei” non sta bene, è infelice nonostante una vita piena ed intensa, è viva, ma dentro si sente morta, tutti la vedono, ma si sente invisibile. La diagnosi è chiara: disforia di genere. Per salvarsi è obbligata ad affrontare un viaggio interiore che forse la porterà verso una nuova luce.","isFamilyFriendly":true,"name":"In viaggio con Lei","url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1324395-in-viaggio-con-lei","countryOfOrigin":[{"@type":"Country","name":"Italia"}],"duration":"PT1H33M","genre":["Documentario"],"image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cTG9EjGd5pPYyDHbuOSUxoUUQPY.jpg","releasedEvent":[{"@type":"PublicationEvent","startDate":"2024-07-28"}],"datePublis